# This repo ONLY tracks the cross-project coordination docs. Everything else in
# SAO/ is either its own git repo (stable-audio-3, stable-audio-tools, torchcodec,
# sa3-rocm7.13-test) or large build artifacts (my_wheels). Ignore all, then
# whitelist the coordination files so a stray `git add .` can never recurse into
# the nested repos or stage gigabytes of checkpoints/latents/venvs.
*
!.gitignore
!MASTER.md
!WORKLOG.md
